<title>USA: Catalyst aiming for Nasdaq listing.</title>
<headline>Catalyst aiming for Nasdaq listing.</headline>
<dateline>SARASOTA, Fla. 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Catalyst Communications Inc said Thursday the company is &quot;aggressively&quot; moving towards its filing for NASDAQ listing.</p>
<p>The company said that it should have all the required financial and legal documentation completed by March 31, at which time it will make immediate application for listing.</p>
<p>Catalyst Communications Inc. provides prepaid phone cards.</p>
</text>
